WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,180 --> 00:00:05,980
What others do in ten days and a half month

2
00:00:05,980 --> 00:00:13,100
I finished Xiao Xi in less than an hour

3
00:00:13,300 --> 00:00:15,100
I'm worried about you

4
00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:17,680
Are you okay? It's okay.

5
00:00:17,880 --> 00:00:19,480
Prepare materials for building a house

6
00:00:20,260 --> 00:00:23,060
This is how much I have saved in the past few days.

7
00:00:23,460 --> 00:00:24,660
How did you do it alone?

8
00:00:24,860 --> 00:00:25,860
Slowly saved up

9
00:00:26,060 --> 00:00:27,860
It’s just that they have been shipped back together in the past few days.

10
00:00:28,260 --> 00:00:29,260
How tiring that is

11
00:00:29,460 --> 00:00:30,460
Brother Qin

12
00:00:30,460 --> 00:00:31,460
Don't be too desperate

13
00:00:31,960 --> 00:00:32,960
don't worry about me

14
00:00:33,360 --> 00:00:35,760
How is Shen Zi's health feeling much better?

15
00:00:35,960 --> 00:00:37,360
I can get to the ground and walk by myself.

16
00:00:38,850 --> 00:00:40,050
this is made for you

17
00:00:40,650 --> 00:00:42,250
You run around in the mountains all day long

18
00:00:42,450 --> 00:00:43,450
Make it more comfortable on the mat

19
00:00:45,520 --> 00:00:46,520
Thank you Xiao Xi

20
00:00:46,920 --> 00:00:50,610
Don’t stay up late doing needlework in the future and it may hurt your eyes, Xiao Xi

21
00:00:51,010 --> 00:00:52,210
Building the house will start tomorrow

22
00:00:52,410 --> 00:00:53,410
The materials are ready

23
00:00:53,610 --> 00:00:55,210
If it's quick, it can be covered in a month.

24
00:00:55,830 --> 00:00:56,830
Wait until the house is built

25
00:00:57,030 --> 00:00:59,730
I will go to your house to propose marriage to Brother Qin
